
Build instructions:

1. cd to the sorc directory

2. To build, install, and clean executable hgefs_enssat

     ./build_hgefs_ensstat.sh >& hgefs.compile.log

3. To build, install, and clean executable hgefs_enssat in debug mode

     ./build_hgefs_ensstat.sh debug >& hgefs.compile.log

4. To build executable hgefs_enssat

     ./build_hgefs_ensstat.sh build >& hgefs.compile.log

5. To clean build files in hgefs_enssat.fd

     ./build_hgefs_ensstat.sh clean >& hgefs.compile.log

6. To install executable hgefs_enssat

     ./build_hgefs_ensstat.sh install >& hgefs.compile.log

